- **U7: Corroborated; designs qualified.** Evidence: Residents' standard patents, provisionals, trade marks and plant breeder's rights match (section 3); innovation patents 53.22% non-resident in 2016 against IP Australia's 54% (ipr-2017 p9); IP Australia: residents 9.3% of standard patents in 2025 (ipr-2026 p22) What follows: Design shares among known origin are lower bounds (D1) Note: The Australian share of standard patents, provisional applications, trade marks and plant breeder's rights matches IP Australia's figures. Designs are the exception: IP Australia counts most designs of unknown origin as Australian, so the share among designs of known origin is a lower bound (D1). Since filled from IP Australia's register (U102).
